    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73935" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀμφᾰκ-ίας</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span>), ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wine from unripe grapes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.26d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as masc.
				Adj., <i>harsh, austere,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					352
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.11d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. νεκροί</span>
			<i>unripe,</i> i.e. <i>untimely,</i> dead, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cat.</u>
				5
			</span></i>.</div>
